# svelte-simple-ui

Welcome — a beautiful, small UI primitives library built for Svelte. This demo site shows the planned components and docs.

<Card>
## What is svelte-simple-ui

Lightweight primitives optimized for accessibility, performance, and DX. Components are designed to be small, themeable, and animated.
</Card>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem">
  <Card>
    <h3>Fast</h3>
    <p>Small bundles, SSR-friendly, adapter-static ready.</p>
  </Card>
  <Card>
    <h3>Accessible</h3>
    <p>Focus styles, aria roles, keyboard-first interactions.</p>
  </Card>
  <Card>
    <h3>Themeable</h3>
    <p>CSS variables, light/dark, easy to customize.</p>
  </Card>
  <Card>
    <h3>Animated</h3>
    <p>Tasteful motion via Motion One with reduced-motion support.</p>
  </Card>
</div>
